{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-87621","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-122884","text":"Weave — a static cost certificate for the [&] stack's resource rung"}]},{"id":"blk-87622","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-122885","text":"A research prototype, built invariant-first: find the invariants, state the rules, enforce them in code, close the loop. Plain Node (v18+), no dependencies. Run any script with "},{"id":"spn-122886","marks":["code"],"text":"node <path>"},{"id":"spn-122887","text":" (e.g. "},{"id":"spn-122888","marks":["code"],"text":"node src/weave.mjs"},{"id":"spn-122889","text":"), or use the npm scripts: "},{"id":"spn-122890","marks":["code"],"text":"npm run demo"},{"id":"spn-122891","text":", "},{"id":"spn-122892","marks":["code"],"text":"npm test"},{"id":"spn-122893","text":", "},{"id":"spn-122894","marks":["code"],"text":"npm run proofs"},{"id":"spn-122895","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-87623","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-122896","marks":["bold"],"text":"Positioning (read `weave-and-the-ampersand-stack.md` first)."},{"id":"spn-122897","text":" Weave began as \"a better Bend/HVM,\" but with box-and-box and OpenSentience in frame that framing is wrong. Weave is "},{"id":"spn-122898","marks":["italic"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-122899","text":" a Bend/HVM competitor — it is a deep probe of one rung of the [&] stack: the "},{"id":"spn-122900","marks":["bold"],"text":"resource rung"},{"id":"spn-122901","text":" (the affine ledger, \"can we afford it\"), and specifically the piece box-and-box doesn't yet have — a "},{"id":"spn-122902","marks":["bold"],"text":"static cost certificate"},{"id":"spn-122903","text":" computed before a computation runs, not a runtime meter read after. HVM4 (now on GitHub in early preview) is the intended execution backend; the cost certificate is substrate-independent, so lowering to HVM4 is an execution choice, not a correctness dependency."}]},{"id":"blk-87624","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-122904","text":"New here? Check the proof, don't take my word for it"}]},{"id":"blk-87625","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-122905","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"./proofs/"}],"text":"`proofs/`"},{"id":"spn-122906","text":" holds "},{"id":"spn-122907","marks":["bold"],"text":"proof you can verify without running anything"},{"id":"spn-122908","text":" from committed text — no install, no run. Read "},{"id":"spn-122909","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"./proofs/README.md"}],"text":"`proofs/README.md`"},{"id":"spn-122910","text":", then eyeball "},{"id":"spn-122911","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"./proofs/RECEIPTS.txt"}],"text":"`proofs/RECEIPTS.txt`"},{"id":"spn-122912","text":" (the static cost grade vs. measured growth, checkable by finite differences; the falsifiable soundness predicate; a cross-check against the independent HVM4 runtime) and "},{"id":"spn-122913","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"./proofs/transcripts/"}],"text":"`proofs/transcripts/`"},{"id":"spn-122914","text":" (the exact stdout of every script, claim-by-claim). Regenerate with "},{"id":"spn-122915","marks":["code"],"text":"node proofs/generate.mjs"},{"id":"spn-122916","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-122917","marks":["code"],"text":"node tools/regenerate-proofs.mjs"},{"id":"spn-122918","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-87626","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-122919","text":"Layout"}]},{"id":"blk-87627","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"weave/\n  README.md                            this file\n  proofs/     RECEIPTS.txt (by-hand-checkable) + transcripts/ (per-script) + generate.mjs + README.md\n  src/        the engine (pure library, exports an API; each runs a demo when invoked directly)\n  test/       the validation suites (differential / property / soundness / cross-engine)\n  surface/    weave_surface.exs        the Elixir macro front-end\n  tools/      regenerate-proofs.mjs    rebuilds proofs/transcripts/ (--check verifies no drift)\n  docs/        positioning + design docs"},{"id":"blk-87628","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-122920","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-122921","text":" — read these first"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-87630","spans":[{"id":"spn-122922","text":"File"}]},{"id":"blk-87631","spans":[{"id":"spn-122923","text":"What it is"}]}],"id":"blk-87629","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-87632","spans":[{"id":"spn-122924","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/weave-and-the-ampersand-stack.md"}]},{"id":"blk-87633","spans":[{"id":"spn-122925","marks":["bold"],"text":"Start here."},{"id":"spn-122926","text":" Repositions Weave inside the [&] stack, grades the stack against the AIOS agent-OS reference (gap analysis), and specifies the cost-certificate → resource-rung integration and the HVM4 backend plan."}]}],[{"id":"blk-87634","spans":[{"id":"spn-122927","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/weave-design.md"}]},{"id":"blk-87635","spans":[{"id":"spn-122928","text":"The design doc: thesis, openings in Bend, the five invariants, the closed loop. "},{"id":"spn-122929","marks":["bold"],"text":"Read after the positioning doc — it predates the [&]-stack reframe and the validation work, so treat it as the starting hypothesis."}]}]]},{"id":"blk-87636","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-122930","marks":["code"],"text":"src/"},{"id":"spn-122931","text":" — the engine"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-87638","spans":[{"id":"spn-122932","text":"File"}]},{"id":"blk-87639","spans":[{"id":"spn-122933","text":"What it is"}]},{"id":"blk-87640","spans":[{"id":"spn-122934","text":"Run"}]}],"id":"blk-87637","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-87641","spans":[{"id":"spn-122935","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-87642","spans":[{"id":"spn-122936","text":"The core. An Interaction-Calculus reducer (β + sup/dup, metered, with time and space vetoes), the static invariant checker (affine / label-coherence / κ), and a small superposed-search + evolution loop."}]},{"id":"blk-87643","spans":[{"id":"spn-122937","marks":["code"],"text":"node src/weave.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87644","spans":[{"id":"spn-122938","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-classify.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-87645","spans":[{"id":"spn-122939","text":"Cost as a type, statically. Infers types, reports the iteration "},{"id":"spn-122940","marks":["italic"],"text":"rank"},{"id":"spn-122941","text":" (poly / exp / tower) with no execution, and cross-checks against measured cost."}]},{"id":"blk-87646","spans":[{"id":"spn-122942","marks":["code"],"text":"node src/weave-classify.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87647","spans":[{"id":"spn-122943","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-eal.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-87648","spans":[{"id":"spn-122944","marks":["bold"],"text":"The certificate."},{"id":"spn-122945","text":" Type-directed EAL box-decoration: the static box-nesting "},{"id":"spn-122946","marks":["italic"],"text":"depth"},{"id":"spn-122947","text":" (= certified elementary tower height) with a per-binder certificate. Upgrades the rank proxy toward a real bound."}]},{"id":"blk-87649","spans":[{"id":"spn-122948","marks":["code"],"text":"node src/weave-eal.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87650","spans":[{"id":"spn-122949","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-eal-degree.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-87651","spans":[{"id":"spn-122950","text":"Stage B: recovers the polynomial "},{"id":"spn-122951","marks":["italic"],"text":"degree"},{"id":"spn-122952","text":" inside the depth-1 rung by finite differences — the measured ground truth that static LAL (Baillot–Terui) would prove."}]},{"id":"blk-87652","spans":[{"id":"spn-122953","marks":["code"],"text":"node src/weave-eal-degree.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87653","spans":[{"id":"spn-122954","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-cost.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-87654","spans":[{"id":"spn-122955","text":"The cost cliff, measured: addition (linear), multiplication (polynomial), exponentiation towers (detonate). Shows source size ≠ cost."}]},{"id":"blk-87655","spans":[{"id":"spn-122956","marks":["code"],"text":"node src/weave-cost.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87656","spans":[{"id":"spn-122957","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-hvm4.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-87657","spans":[{"id":"spn-122958","text":"Local round-trip lowering to a generic HVM-core syntax + inverse parser (semantics-preserving validation, no external binary)."}]},{"id":"blk-87658","spans":[{"id":"spn-122959","marks":["code"],"text":"node src/weave-hvm4.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87659","spans":[{"id":"spn-122960","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-backend.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-87660","spans":[{"id":"spn-122961","text":"The \"backend\" the surface lowers to (the Nx/EXLA role): reads an IR term as JSON and runs the real engine."}]},{"id":"blk-87661","spans":[{"id":"spn-122962","marks":["code"],"text":"node src/weave-backend.mjs <op> '<ir-json>'"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-87662","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-122963","marks":["code"],"text":"test/"},{"id":"spn-122964","text":" — the validation suites"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-87664","spans":[{"id":"spn-122965","text":"File"}]},{"id":"blk-87665","spans":[{"id":"spn-122966","text":"What it is"}]},{"id":"blk-87666","spans":[{"id":"spn-122967","text":"Run"}]}],"id":"blk-87663","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-87667","spans":[{"id":"spn-122968","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-validate.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-87668","spans":[{"id":"spn-122969","text":"Differential testing: linearize a pure λ-term, reduce with Weave, compare the normal form to a reference normal-order evaluator. "},{"id":"spn-122970","marks":["bold"],"text":"12/12."}]},{"id":"blk-87669","spans":[{"id":"spn-122971","marks":["code"],"text":"node test/weave-validate.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87670","spans":[{"id":"spn-122972","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-proptest.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-87671","spans":[{"id":"spn-122973","text":"Checker-gated property testing over thousands of random simply-typed terms. None mis-evaluated."}]},{"id":"blk-87672","spans":[{"id":"spn-122974","marks":["code"],"text":"node test/weave-proptest.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87673","spans":[{"id":"spn-122975","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-soundness.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-87674","spans":[{"id":"spn-122976","text":"Stress-tests the classifier verdict against measured cost over an adversarial battery + ~2000 random terms. Falsifiable predicate: no rank≤1 term detonated."}]},{"id":"blk-87675","spans":[{"id":"spn-122977","marks":["code"],"text":"node test/weave-soundness.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87676","spans":[{"id":"spn-122978","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-fold-test.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-87677","spans":[{"id":"spn-122979","text":"Differential test for the structural-recursion layer: linearized "},{"id":"spn-122980","marks":["code"],"text":"fold"},{"id":"spn-122981","text":" vs JS ground truth over random lists × {add, mul, sub}. "},{"id":"spn-122982","marks":["bold"],"text":"1200/1200."}]},{"id":"blk-87678","spans":[{"id":"spn-122983","marks":["code"],"text":"node test/weave-fold-test.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87679","spans":[{"id":"spn-122984","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-eal-test.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-87680","spans":[{"id":"spn-122985","text":"Validates the EAL "},{"id":"spn-122986","marks":["bold"],"text":"certificate"},{"id":"spn-122987","text":" against "},{"id":"spn-122988","marks":["italic"],"text":"measured"},{"id":"spn-122989","text":" cost (not the proxy): certified-cheap never detonates, "},{"id":"spn-122990","marks":["code"],"text":"eal:true"},{"id":"spn-122991","text":" reduces oracle-free (no residue), depth matches the validated rank."}]},{"id":"blk-87681","spans":[{"id":"spn-122992","marks":["code"],"text":"node test/weave-eal-test.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87682","spans":[{"id":"spn-122993","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-hvm4-run.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-87683","spans":[{"id":"spn-122994","text":"The real HVM4 backend: lowers to HVM4 surface syntax, shells to the built binary, and differential-tests integer outputs against the toy reducer. "},{"id":"spn-122995","marks":["bold"],"text":"6/6."},{"id":"spn-122996","text":" Needs "},{"id":"spn-122997","marks":["code"],"text":"~/hvm4/src/hvm"},{"id":"spn-122998","text":" (or "},{"id":"spn-122999","marks":["code"],"text":"HVM4_BIN="},{"id":"spn-123000","text":")."}]},{"id":"blk-87684","spans":[{"id":"spn-123001","marks":["code"],"text":"node test/weave-hvm4-run.mjs"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-87685","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-123002","marks":["code"],"text":"surface/"},{"id":"spn-123003","text":" — the Elixir front-end"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-87687","spans":[{"id":"spn-123004","text":"File"}]},{"id":"blk-87688","spans":[{"id":"spn-123005","text":"What it is"}]},{"id":"blk-87689","spans":[{"id":"spn-123006","text":"Run"}]}],"id":"blk-87686","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-87690","spans":[{"id":"spn-123007","marks":["code"],"text":"surface/weave_surface.exs"}]},{"id":"blk-87691","spans":[{"id":"spn-123008","text":"An Elixir macro surface. "},{"id":"spn-123009","marks":["code"],"text":"defweave"},{"id":"spn-123010","text":" compiles native "},{"id":"spn-123011","marks":["code"],"text":"fn"},{"id":"spn-123012","text":" syntax — integer literals, "},{"id":"spn-123013","marks":["code"],"text":"+"},{"id":"spn-123014","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-123015","marks":["code"],"text":"*"},{"id":"spn-123016","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-123017","marks":["code"],"text":"-"},{"id":"spn-123018","text":", list literals, "},{"id":"spn-123019","marks":["code"],"text":"fold"},{"id":"spn-123020","text":" — into Weave IR at compile time, then shells to "},{"id":"spn-123021","marks":["code"],"text":"../src/weave-backend.mjs"},{"id":"spn-123022","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-87692","spans":[{"id":"spn-123023","marks":["code"],"text":"elixir surface/weave_surface.exs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-87693","spans":[{"id":"spn-123024","marks":["code"],"text":"surface/weave_govern.exs"}]},{"id":"blk-87694","spans":[{"id":"spn-123025","marks":["bold"],"text":"The stack, end to end."},{"id":"spn-123026","text":" Authors four plans with "},{"id":"spn-123027","marks":["code"],"text":"defweave"},{"id":"spn-123028","text":", certifies each one's cost class with "},{"id":"spn-123029","marks":["code"],"text":"Weave.classify"},{"id":"spn-123030","text":" (static — no execution), shells to the box-and-box governance kernel (the highest-utility exponential is "},{"id":"spn-123031","marks":["bold"],"text":"annihilated"},{"id":"spn-123032","text":" "},{"id":"spn-123033","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-123034","text":" by the resource-rung floor), "},{"id":"spn-123035","marks":["bold"],"text":"runs"},{"id":"spn-123036","text":" the polynomial winner to a real answer ("},{"id":"spn-123037","marks":["code"],"text":"210"},{"id":"spn-123038","text":"), then runs the refused tower anyway and watches it "},{"id":"spn-123039","marks":["bold"],"text":"detonate"},{"id":"spn-123040","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-123041","marks":["code"],"text":"over-space"},{"id":"spn-123042","text":") — vindicating the static refusal. Cost is a type, and the type decides."}]},{"id":"blk-87695","spans":[{"id":"spn-123043","marks":["code"],"text":"elixir surface/weave_govern.exs"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-87696","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-123044","text":"Honest status"}]},{"id":"blk-87697","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123045","text":"What runs and is validated:"}]},{"id":"blk-87698","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-87700","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123046","text":"The reducer is sound on every term tested — the 12-term battery plus ~3000 random simply-typed"}]}],"id":"blk-87699","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-87701","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123047","text":"terms plus Church arithmetic. No counterexample found."}]},{"id":"blk-87702","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-87704","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123048","text":"The cost cliff is real and measured; the static classifier predicts it from structure before"}]}],"id":"blk-87703","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-87705","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123049","text":"running, and the prediction matches."}]},{"id":"blk-87706","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-87708","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123050","marks":["bold"],"text":"Recursion fork: decided."},{"id":"spn-123051","text":" The surface offers "},{"id":"spn-123052","marks":["italic"],"text":"structural"},{"id":"spn-123053","text":" recursion (fold over a list),"}]}],"id":"blk-87707","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-87709","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123054","text":"not a general "},{"id":"spn-123055","marks":["code"],"text":"fix"},{"id":"spn-123056","text":". A Church-encoded list is its own right fold, so recursion on the spine is total, has no fixpoint, and stays in the elementary/certified fragment — the feature is also the limit, by design."}]},{"id":"blk-87710","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-87712","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123057","marks":["bold"],"text":"Primitives + a list ADT are in, and the surface is now writable."},{"id":"spn-123058","text":" Native integers and "},{"id":"spn-123059","marks":["code"],"text":"+"},{"id":"spn-123060","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-123061","marks":["code"],"text":"*"},{"id":"spn-123062","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-123063","marks":["code"],"text":"-"}]}],"id":"blk-87711","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-87713","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123064","text":"lower to a strict "},{"id":"spn-123065","marks":["code"],"text":"Op"},{"id":"spn-123066","text":" node (type-order 0, no cost-rank contribution); list literals lower to Church lists; "},{"id":"spn-123067","marks":["code"],"text":"fold"},{"id":"spn-123068","text":" is the list applied. Duplicating an "},{"id":"spn-123069","marks":["code"],"text":"Op"},{"id":"spn-123070","text":"-carrying combiner needed one new rule — "},{"id":"spn-123071","marks":["code"],"text":"OP-SUP"},{"id":"spn-123072","text":", the operator/superposition commutation, exactly parallel to the existing "},{"id":"spn-123073","marks":["code"],"text":"APP-SUP"},{"id":"spn-123074","text":". With it, linearized folds match JS ground truth "},{"id":"spn-123075","marks":["bold"],"text":"1200/1200"},{"id":"spn-123076","text":" over random lists and operators, and "},{"id":"spn-123077","marks":["code"],"text":"sum"},{"id":"spn-123078","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-123079","marks":["code"],"text":"product"},{"id":"spn-123080","text":" over a list literal run end-to-end through Elixir and classify rank-1 polynomial."}]},{"id":"blk-87714","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123081","text":"What is a corrected claim (the validation overturned earlier guesses):"}]},{"id":"blk-87715","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-87717","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123082","text":"An early discussion called Church multiplication the \"oracle boundary.\" That was wrong — it was a"}]}],"id":"blk-87716","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-87718","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123083","text":"missing "},{"id":"spn-123084","marks":["code"],"text":"DUP-APP"},{"id":"spn-123085","text":" commutation rule in the reducer, since fixed. There is no known boundary within the tested fragment."}]},{"id":"blk-87719","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-87721","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123086","text":"The static invariants "},{"id":"spn-123087","marks":["code"],"text":"I1"},{"id":"spn-123088","text":" (affine) + "},{"id":"spn-123089","marks":["code"],"text":"I2"},{"id":"spn-123090","text":" (labels) are "},{"id":"spn-123091","marks":["bold"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-123092","text":" sufficient for soundness — a term"}]}],"id":"blk-87720","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-87722","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123093","text":"exists that they accept but a naive reducer mis-evaluates. They are a source-level discipline, not a soundness certificate."}]},{"id":"blk-87723","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123094","text":"What is a heuristic, not a theorem:"}]},{"id":"blk-87724","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-87726","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123095","marks":["code"],"text":"weave-classify"},{"id":"spn-123096","text":" uses STLC type-order as a proxy for the complexity rung. It is principled"}]}],"id":"blk-87725","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-87727","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123097","text":"(higher-order iteration climbs the Grzegorczyk hierarchy) and validated on these families, but it is an under-approximation of full Elementary/Light-Affine inference, reports the ladder "},{"id":"spn-123098","marks":["italic"],"text":"rung"},{"id":"spn-123099","text":" not the polynomial degree, and goes silent on terms that aren't simply-typable."}]},{"id":"blk-87728","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-123100","text":"The thesis, as far as it's earned"}]},{"id":"blk-87729","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123101","text":"The defensible core is substructural: you get a guarantee by removing the structural rule that would let you violate it, so the violation becomes inexpressible. In this style the "},{"id":"spn-123102","marks":["italic"],"text":"safety invariant"},{"id":"spn-123103","text":" and the "},{"id":"spn-123104","marks":["italic"],"text":"cost guarantee"},{"id":"spn-123105","text":" are the same object — linearity-with-stratification simultaneously makes reduction sound, licenses the oracle-free fast path, and grades cost. Two of those faces now have running artifacts (soundness: "},{"id":"spn-123106","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-validate"},{"id":"spn-123107","text":"; cost: "},{"id":"spn-123108","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-classify"},{"id":"spn-123109","text":"), and all three are exhibited together — checkable by hand — in "},{"id":"spn-123110","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"./proofs/RECEIPTS.txt"}],"text":"`proofs/RECEIPTS.txt`"},{"id":"spn-123111","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-87730","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123112","text":"Placed in the [&] stack, this is the "},{"id":"spn-123113","marks":["bold"],"text":"resource rung"},{"id":"spn-123114","text":" made into a static certificate. box-and-box's resource rung is a "},{"id":"spn-123115","marks":["italic"],"text":"runtime"},{"id":"spn-123116","text":" ledger (\"what was spent\"); Weave is the "},{"id":"spn-123117","marks":["italic"],"text":"static"},{"id":"spn-123118","text":" certificate (\"what can be spent, in what class, with termination guaranteed\"). Wired into "},{"id":"spn-123119","marks":["code"],"text":"govern()"},{"id":"spn-123120","text":", a computation that can't be certified to halt within budget becomes "},{"id":"spn-123121","marks":["code"],"text":"0̄"},{"id":"spn-123122","text":" — annihilated, not down-ranked — the same floor pattern the kernel already uses for forbidden actions. Three of your theses converge here: "},{"id":"spn-123123","marks":["bold"],"text":"symbol-as-system"},{"id":"spn-123124","text":" (the verdict is the arithmetic), "},{"id":"spn-123125","marks":["bold"],"text":"topology-as-warrant"},{"id":"spn-123126","text":" (κ licenses the shape of the reasoning), and "},{"id":"spn-123127","marks":["bold"],"text":"cost-as-certificate"},{"id":"spn-123128","text":" (the discipline that makes the fast path sound is the one that bounds cost). See "},{"id":"spn-123129","marks":["code"],"text":"weave-and-the-ampersand-stack.md"},{"id":"spn-123130","text":" for the full integration and gap analysis."}]},{"id":"blk-87731","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123131","marks":["bold"],"text":"Update — the next step is taken (partway)."},{"id":"spn-123132","text":" "},{"id":"spn-123133","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-eal.mjs"},{"id":"spn-123134","text":" now computes a real EAL box-decoration: a static box-nesting "},{"id":"spn-123135","marks":["italic"],"text":"depth"},{"id":"spn-123136","text":" (= certified elementary tower height) with a per-binder certificate, validated against "},{"id":"spn-123137","marks":["italic"],"text":"measured"},{"id":"spn-123138","text":" cost in "},{"id":"spn-123139","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-eal-test.mjs"},{"id":"spn-123140","text":" (certified-cheap never detonated; every "},{"id":"spn-123141","marks":["code"],"text":"eal:true"},{"id":"spn-123142","text":" term reduced oracle-free). The depth-1 rung's polynomial "},{"id":"spn-123143","marks":["italic"],"text":"degree"},{"id":"spn-123144","text":" is recovered empirically in "},{"id":"spn-123145","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-eal-degree.mjs"},{"id":"spn-123146","text":". And "},{"id":"spn-123147","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-hvm4-run.mjs"},{"id":"spn-123148","text":" wires the real HVM4 backend (6/6 differential agreement), confirming the certificate is substrate-independent."}]},{"id":"blk-87732","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123149","text":"What remains genuinely open: the polynomial "},{"id":"spn-123150","marks":["bold"],"text":"degree"},{"id":"spn-123151","text":" is still "},{"id":"spn-123152","marks":["italic"],"text":"measured"},{"id":"spn-123153","text":", not statically inferred. Pinning it by type is "},{"id":"spn-123154","marks":["bold"],"text":"static LAL"},{"id":"spn-123155","text":" inference (Light Affine Logic / Baillot–Terui §-boxes) — the named boundary. EAL gives the certified "},{"id":"spn-123156","marks":["italic"],"text":"tower height"},{"id":"spn-123157","text":"; LAL would give the certified "},{"id":"spn-123158","marks":["italic"],"text":"degree"},{"id":"spn-123159","text":"."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieragocjqpvm7o77l2nfqbqqzsj6t7fzyuea5fpf6mykirih7illcqiq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}